  'A small-group Busan day built around the coast and the hillside villages: Haedong Yonggungsa seaside temple in its quiet morning window, the free glass-floor Daritdol Observatory at Cheongsapo, the Blueline Park Sky Capsule ride from Cheongsapo to Mipo (ticket included or excluded — choose at booking), lunch, Gamcheon Culture Village, and the little-known Dakbatgol mural village where a free monorail glides up the ''wish stairs''. Every anchor except the optional capsule is free admission.',
